  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Ethanol should be considered yo be a non-volatile solute as per the given options.</p><p><img src=\"assets\\ot4_0010_206236c6836c.jpeg\"/></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>ΔT</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></msub><mo>×</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math>,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>ΔT</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>34</mn><mo>.5</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>46</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.5</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math>,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mn>273</mn><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math>,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>270</mn><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math>.</p><p> </p>"
